      <item>
        <title>R to @OpenAI: These optimizations across our stack compound to unlock the most performant models at every point in the cost-intelligence curve. https://openai.com/index/gpt-5-6-frontier-intelligence-efficiency/</title>
        <dc:creator>@OpenAI</dc:creator>
        <description><![CDATA[<p>These optimizations across our stack compound to unlock the most performant models at every point in the cost-intelligence curve. <br>
<a href="https://openai.com/index/gpt-5-6-frontier-intelligence-efficiency/">openai.com/index/gpt-5-6-fro…</a></p>
<hr/>
<b>Link</b><br>
