      </item>
      <item>
        <title>At the core of our mission is working through how to ensure increasingly powerful AI benefits everyone. We believe that, at some point in the future, AI acceleration for frontier model development may be so high that the world will need to pace the rate of AI advancement. We hope to contribute to work led by the U.S. government, alongside other labs and the open-source community, to develop the tools and mechanisms that could make that possible. http://pacingthefrontier.com</title>
        <dc:creator>@OpenAI</dc:creator>
        <description><![CDATA[<p>At the core of our mission is working through how to ensure increasingly powerful AI benefits everyone. <br>
<br>
We believe that, at some point in the future, AI acceleration for frontier model development may be so high that the world will need to pace the rate of AI advancement. <br>
<br>
We hope to contribute to work led by the U.S. government, alongside other labs and the open-source community, to develop the tools and mechanisms that could make that possible.<br>
<br>
<a href="http://pacingthefrontier.com">pacingthefrontier.com</a></p>
<hr/>
<b>Link</b><br>
<a href="http://pacingthefrontier.com">
<img src="https://nitter.net/pic/card_img%2F2082104365939081216%2FMCEgDjJo%3Fformat%3Djpg%26name%3D800x419" style="max-width:250px;" />
<br>
<b>Pacing the Frontier</b>
</a>
<p>A statement from over 1000 employees of frontier AI companies</p>
<small><a href="http://pacingthefrontier.com">pacingthefrontier.com</a></small>]]></description>
        <pubDate>Tue, 28 Jul 2026 20:56:52 GMT</pubDate>
        <guid isPermaLink="false">2082208694142730340</guid>
        <link>https://nitter.net/OpenAI/status/2082208694142730340#m</link>
      </item>

